COMMENT ON COLUMN EHRM.HRM_DEPT_HIERARCHY_DETAIL.DEPT_HIERARCHY_ID         IS '조직도ID';
COMMENT ON COLUMN EHRM.HRM_DEPT_HIERARCHY_DETAIL.PARENT_DEPT_ID            IS '상위부서ID';
COMMENT ON COLUMN EHRM.HRM_DEPT_HIERARCHY_DETAIL.CHILD_DEPT_ID             IS '하위부서ID';
